@HelpDesk.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5091
@token = paste-access-token-from-login-here

### Login, then copy accessToken into @token above
POST {{HelpDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@company.example",
  "password": "your-local-admin-password"
}

### Current user profile
GET {{HelpDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### List tickets
GET {{HelpDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets?status=Open&priority=High&search=VPN&sortBy=createdAt&sortDirection=desc&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Create a ticket (requesterId is ignored; requester comes from the token)
POST {{HelpDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "VPN connection issue",
  "description": "Unable to connect to the company VPN.",
  "priority": "High",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "requesterId": 999
}

### Get a ticket
GET {{HelpDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Update a ticket
PUT {{HelpDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "VPN connection issue",
  "description": "Unable to connect to the company VPN.",
  "priority": "High",
  "status": "InProgress",
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Add a public comment (authorId is taken from the token)
POST {{HelpDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Investigating the issue.",
  "isInternal": false
}

### Add an internal note (Agent/Admin only)
POST {{HelpDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Checking internal service logs.",
  "isInternal": true
}

### Assign a ticket (Agent/Admin only)
PUT {{HelpDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1/assignment
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assigneeId": 2
}

### List categories
GET {{HelpDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### List departments
GET {{HelpDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
